1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,100
Didi: Everyone grab a cart by the entrance.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,900
(Team) Mine has one wheel and no brakes.

3
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,000
(Team) the yellow cart for the steep hill.

4
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,100
(Team) I see two zombies by the fountain.

5
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,100
Didi: The bridge is blocked by a delivery van.

6
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:39,300
(Team) found another ramp behind the garage.

7
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:34,100
Didi: Take the blue route around the corner.

8
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,900
(Team) will grab the cart on the other side.

9
00:03:03,900 --> 00:03:06,000
(Team) The vending machine is coming with us.

10
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:28,100
(Team) Leave the door open for the last cart.

11
00:03:55,100 --> 00:03:57,200
(Team) will restart my recording at the gate.

12
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:23,100
Didi: Wait for the gate to go all the way up.

13
00:04:32,300 --> 00:04:34,400
(Team) Cart is balanced on the railing.

14
00:04:33,450 --> 00:04:35,550
(Team) is moving and nobody is pushing it.

15
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:41,100
Didi: It tipped straight into the fountain.

16
00:04:50,900 --> 00:04:53,000
(Team) My recording is back after the gate.

17
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,100
(Team) it over to the playground slide.

18
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:46,100
Didi: There is a zombie in the shopping cart.

19
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:55,500
(Team) the cart is sliding too!

20
00:05:55,700 --> 00:05:57,800
(Team) Whole cart landed on the roof.

21
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,900
(Team) There goes our getaway vehicle.

22
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:04,100
Didi: I caught the landing from the playground.

23
00:06:47,100 --> 00:06:49,200
(Team) We should race four carts down the slide.

24
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:15,300
(Team) green one is fast but it rolls over.

25
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:47,100
Didi: Someone left the ramp beside the truck.

26
00:08:27,700 --> 00:08:29,800
(Team) Let us park everything under the bridge.
